      "text": "# dsh-spend-plus bundle patch — mounts BOTH halves in one package:\n#   1. `usage-stats` — the dsh-spend usage/cost dashboard (Typert Remote service).\n#   2. `balance`     — the DeepSeek account balance + session-cost readout\n#                      (merged from dsh-balance-meter, served via /api/balance).\n- insert:\n    - id: usage-stats\n      name: 'dsh-spend-plus'\n      config:\n        currency: USD            # CNY (¥) or USD ($)\n        maxSessions: 20\n        maxRecentCalls: 50\n        seriesHours: 168\n        refreshSeconds: 30\n    - id: balance\n      name: 'dsh-spend-plus/balance'\n      config:\n        refreshIntervalSeconds: 30\n"
